      "text": "Casual (family / friends):\n  食べる / 高い\n\nPolite (everyday situations):\n  食べます / 高いです\n\nFormal (respectful & humble):\n  尊敬語: 召し上がる (honor. eat / drink)\n  謙譲語: いただく (humble receive / eat)\n\nRemember: word order stays SOV; politeness is carried by the verb ending and word choice.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
